{
  "id": "6a904a42fbd4ce1da55152d3",
  "title": "いろいろな収入",
  "created": 1787841093,
  "updated": 1787841911,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6a904a42fbd4ce1da55152d3",
      "text": "いろいろな収入",
      "userId": "6a257912c40c8afba490c3cc",
      "created": 1787841093,
      "updated": 1787841093
    },
    {
      "id": "6a904a460000000000772678",
      "text": "　時間の切り売り",
      "userId": "6a257912c40c8afba490c3cc",
      "created": 1787841093,
      "updated": 1787841111
    },
    {
      "id": "6a904a59000000000077267a",
      "text": "　　わかりやすいのは時給。でも月給も年俸もそうかもしれない",
      "userId": "6a257912c40c8afba490c3cc",
      "created": 1787841112,
      "updated": 1787841143
    },
    {
      "id": "6a904a470000000000772679",
      "text": "　　　残業で手取りが増えても稼いでるとは言えないと思っている",
      "userId": "6a257912c40c8afba490c3cc",
      "created": 1787841094,
      "updated": 1787841164
    },
    {
      "id": "6a904b440000000000772682",
      "text": "　　転売もここか",
      "userId": "6a257912c40c8afba490c3cc",
      "created": 1787841347,
      "updated": 1787841352
    },
    {
      "id": "6a904b4b0000000000772683",
      "text": "　時間の切り売り（経験値つき）",
      "userId": "6a257912c40c8afba490c3cc",
      "created": 1787841354,
      "updated": 1787841380
    },
    {
      "id": "6a904b650000000000772684",
      "text": "　　収入面では時間の切り売りだが、経験値や信頼などが付随するもの",
      "userId": "6a257912c40c8afba490c3cc",
      "created": 1787841380,
      "updated": 1787841406
    },
    {
      "id": "6a904cca000000000077268d",
      "text": "　スキルの提供？",
      "userId": "6a257912c40c8afba490c3cc",
      "created": 1787841737,
      "updated": 1787841745
    },
    {
      "id": "6a904cd2000000000077268e",
      "text": "　　AIによって下落していることがある分野",
      "userId": "6a257912c40c8afba490c3cc",
      "created": 1787841745,
      "updated": 1787841761
    },
    {
      "id": "6a904bb10000000000772687",
      "text": "　逆に、収入になっていないが経験値と信頼を得ているもの",
      "userId": "6a257912c40c8afba490c3cc",
      "created": 1787841457,
      "updated": 1787841475
    },
    {
      "id": "6a904a7a000000000077267b",
      "text": "　←ここについて考え中",
      "userId": "6a257912c40c8afba490c3cc",
      "created": 1787841146,
      "updated": 1787841252
    },
    {
      "id": "6a904a8d000000000077267c",
      "text": "　お金がお金を稼ぐ",
      "userId": "6a257912c40c8afba490c3cc",
      "created": 1787841165,
      "updated": 1787841183
    },
    {
      "id": "6a904ac0000000000077267f",
      "text": "　　投資",
      "userId": "6a257912c40c8afba490c3cc",
      "created": 1787841215,
      "updated": 1787841218
    },
    {
      "id": "6a904ac30000000000772680",
      "text": "　　投機は？",
      "userId": "6a257912c40c8afba490c3cc",
      "created": 1787841218,
      "updated": 1787841228
    },
    {
      "id": "6a904aa0000000000077267e",
      "text": "　　金融、お金を必要としてる人にお金を提供してお金を得るってすごい商売だな",
      "userId": "6a257912c40c8afba490c3cc",
      "created": 1787841183,
      "updated": 1787841911
    },
    {
      "id": "6a904a91000000000077267d",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6a257912c40c8afba490c3cc",
      "created": 1787841168,
      "updated": 1787841168
    },
    {
      "id": "6a904c040000000000772688",
      "text": "　生活のための労働",
      "userId": "6a257912c40c8afba490c3cc",
      "created": 1787841539,
      "updated": 1787841544
    },
    {
      "id": "6a904c060000000000772689",
      "text": "　親の資産",
      "userId": "6a257912c40c8afba490c3cc",
      "created": 1787841541,
      "updated": 1787841548
    },
    {
      "id": "6a904c0d000000000077268a",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6a257912c40c8afba490c3cc",
      "created": 1787841548,
      "updated": 1787841548
    },
    {
      "id": "6a904c1f000000000077268b",
      "text": "　生活の為じゃない労働",
      "userId": "6a257912c40c8afba490c3cc",
      "created": 1787841566,
      "updated": 1787841570
    },
    {
      "id": "6a904c1f000000000077268c",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6a257912c40c8afba490c3cc",
      "created": 1787841566,
      "updated": 1787841566
    },
    {
      "id": "6a904cec000000000077268f",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6a257912c40c8afba490c3cc",
      "created": 1787841772,
      "updated": 1787841772
    },
    {
      "id": "6a904cec0000000000772690",
      "text": "　好きなことで稼ぐ",
      "userId": "6a257912c40c8afba490c3cc",
      "created": 1787841772,
      "updated": 1787841775
    },
    {
      "id": "6a904cf00000000000772692",
      "text": "　　本人に好きな事の定義がある場合とそうでない場合で意味が変わってくるフレーズ",
      "userId": "6a257912c40c8afba490c3cc",
      "created": 1787841775,
      "updated": 1787841814
    },
    {
      "id": "6a904ced0000000000772691",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6a257912c40c8afba490c3cc",
      "created": 1787841772,
      "updated": 1787841772
    }
  ]
}